Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
# Brand: Epson
# Models: Most Epson projectors (PowerLite, Pro, Home Cinema) on remote ID 0
# Source: Epson projector NEC code set (address 0x5583), as used by Flipper's universal projector remote
# Tested: no
# Notes: Power off asks for confirmation: send Power twice, a second or two apart.
#
name: Power
type: parsed
protocol: NECext
address: 83 55 00 00
command: 90 6F 00 00
